@darpa @dod #darpa stole and implemented from me: https://t.co/pQvmLQ2PsR\n\nI invent tons of their stuff, and sh1ts getting old they never paying me for it though.\n\nWhat you\'re about to watch would be classified military secrets, if I didn\'t publish talks about this prior.\n\nIt\'s as simple as modern drones have:\n\n1) Remote Control\n2) GPS nav point automatic drive\n\nThey\'re adding:\n\n3) When E&M jammed, fly to a light instead of crashing or ascending out of the E&M jam bubble.\n\n4) Map roads nearby and fly along roads.\n\n5) Exit positions of houses \n\n6) Two drones share primitive and incomplete mapping information of fog of war.\n\nIt\'s nothing to get excited over, but you can\'t get as much debug info in the desert, for you need uneven terrain.\n\nAgain, DOD didn\'t care if I talk about this. I emailed em and they were all cool about not responding, and I\'ve done talks on this.  How much shiit does one man gotta invent before he gets a job, and not stolen from.  You\'re the God damned government man, you don\'t have to stiff me 34,000$ and just steal my ip.  That\'s what Big Tech does: https://t.co/Y1XmW9OV2V\nOr: https://t.co/YZXJlsr3fN\n\nOr: https://t.co/sLkgDjbKE9\n\nOr: https://t.co/EkSVaGX34i\n\nAt this point I feel I\'m on a government watch list who\'s purpose is to make sure I never get paid for any work I do.\n\n@RealAlexJones @elonmusk @AirForceGaming @usairforce @fcc', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [{'indices': [630, 634], 'text': 'DOD'}, {'indices': [647, 653], 'text': 'darpa'}], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [{'display_url': 'rumble.com/v556o3l-browsi…', 'expanded_url': 'https://rumble.com/v556o3l-browsing-social-media-with-a-dude-who-knows-jesus-is-real-and-is-also-the-s.html', 'url': 'https://t.co/pQvmLQ2PsR', 'indices': [685, 708]}, {'display_url': 'x.com/JamesSager/sta…', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/JamesSager/status/1729102854206447896', 'url': 'https://t.co/Y1XmW9OV2V', 'indices': [1723, 1746]}, {'display_url': 'x.co